  maxHealth: 700
  contactDamage: 2
  scoreReward: 12000
  description: What it births is worse than what it is, and what it is is a nursery
    of eyes. None of them blink. All of them are counting.
  tactics: 'The swarm boss (difficulty 7): rift squares erupt HOMING volleys - five
    hunters from a point of your recent past - while Locusts spill continuously.
    Clear Locusts with your natural spread; save deliberate aim for the mother. Womb
    of Nothing (30%) adds dense rift rings: the squares now demand immediate evacuation.'
  displayName: The Voidmother
  difficulty: 7
